  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "realization/1: the plan Adaptation makes by stage and certainty (docs/reference/j2/docs/realization-schema.json),\nthe `plan` of a realization.json. J2 sends a plan with faults back once, so an empty list is not refused here:\n`plan_faults` of the record says what is wrong.",
